{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology\/web' data-target='computer\/technology\/web' data-title='Web'>\r\n\t\t\tWeb\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"ETag revalidation returns Not_modified; file versioning is the way to invalidate before expiry. Cache 1 week to 1 year.","label":"Caching","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/web\/ad_size","label":"Ad Size","url":"\/computer\/technology\/web\/ad_size"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/web\/css","label":"CSS","url":"\/computer\/technology\/web\/css"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>ETag header<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf the cache expires, the client requests with the ETag = fingerprint (as sent by the server in the past). The server checks the fingerprint and returns <code class='inline'>Not_modified<\/code> if not changed.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf the file changes before it expires in the cache, that cannot be communicated to the browser.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThus, file versioning (by index \/ fingerprinting) is recommended for invalidation control.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Recommended expiry<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t1 week to 1 year for resources.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/web\/caching\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/web\/caching\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/web\/ad_size' data-target='computer\/technology\/web\/ad_size' data-title='Ad Size' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Ad Size<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/web\/css' data-target='computer\/technology\/web\/css' data-title='CSS' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/technology\/web\/css.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>CSS<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/technology\/web' data-target='computer\/technology\/web' data-title='Web'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Web<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}